      "1. Ensure GLOBANT_API_KEY and GLOBANT_ORG_ID are configured in .env",
      "2. Verify API access with: python -c \"from model_api_integration import ModelAPIFactory; c = ModelAPIFactory.create_client('globant'); print(c.generate('Hello', {'model': 'openai/gpt-4o-mini', 'max_tokens': 50}))\"",
      "3. Run analysis with: python main.py --query 'test' --models 3"
    ],
